They really are a bunch of crazy old-timers.
Anyone, everyone in exchange for growing up

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:14.700
Anyone, everyone in exchange for growing up

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:15.540
Don't you think?
Anyone, everyone in exchange for growing up

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:17.750
Anyone, everyone in exchange for growing up

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:21.040
Energy at 0009. Enough for one shot.
Anyone, everyone in exchange for growing up

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:22.420
Got it!

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:24.300
We'll settle everything at once!

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:25.210
Right!

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:28.510
El Dora Fist!

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:34.640
We don't have enough energy! We're just a little short!

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:36.220
Old-guys...

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:37.980
just fade away.

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:45.070
Eldora Five is...

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:47.530
Could this be it?

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:48.690
No way.

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:49.860
Old-timers...

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:51.610
That's enough! Stop it!

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.820
They'll die if you keep this up!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.290
It'll take more than this to kill us!

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:00.250
They can't take any more!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.380
Grandma!

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:25.440
What is that?

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:28.780
What?

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:33.610
Chizuru...

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:37.330
It's complete!

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:38.370
Oh my...

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:41.080
Even the supply unit is out of date.

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:58.390
It's an inefficient Armor. Where's the advancement?

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:00.970
Sonny, advancement is when...

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:03.560
the Armor and the human spirit...

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:05.060
combine.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:07.440
El Dora Five!

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:09.270
Ultimate!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.540
No! It can't be!

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:27.210
Adios!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.340
Amigo!

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.340
They did it!

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:38.760
El Dora Five really is the best! Gracias!

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:42.310
Franco...

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:44.440
I realized it.

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:49.520
I love the old-timers and this town.

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:52.820
By the way, who was that?

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:55.820
That unsung hero who gave everything he had.

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:59.120
The man who gave everything he had.

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:04.370
I'm alive?

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:06.000
