00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:08.210
You can't even say you're sorry?

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:09.630
I'm sorry!

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:10.840
All right.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:13.840
