00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:18.050
Come back and help the town when you've atoned for your crime.

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:20.470
Yes.

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:40.780
Oh, are you already done servicing the Eldora Five?

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:43.200
Yep. Thanks to the young people.

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:46.870
Speaking of which, where's Van and the young lady?

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:48.290
They've already left.

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:50.750
They said they're looking for someone.

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:55.210
What? I thought I'd teach him the essence of riding an Armor.

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:56.130
Oh my...

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:01.930
You're awake, Carlos?

00:22:03.810 --> 00:22:08.100
Dear me... Anyway can I get a drink too?

00:22:08.270 --> 00:22:10.270
I don't know why but I'm exhausted.

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:12.400
Did you have a strange dream?

00:22:12.400 --> 00:22:14.780
No, it was a pleasant one.

00:22:15.110 --> 00:22:17.740
We were all fighting against an Armor that was attacking the town.

00:22:17.740 --> 00:22:22.780
Oh, right, Chizuru was there too. It really was a good dream.

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:24.080
Carlos...

00:22:27.580 --> 00:22:32.130
That wasn't a dream!

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:55.330
And the Rain Kept Falling

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:56.540
Yes, that's right.
And the Rain Kept Falling

