And the Rain Kept Falling

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:06.180
Since this is the first time I've spoken about it.
And the Rain Kept Falling

00:24:06.180 --> 00:24:06.930
And the Rain Kept Falling

00:24:06.930 --> 00:24:08.930
It may seem like it was an ordinary day...
And the Rain Kept Falling

00:24:08.930 --> 00:24:11.310
when compared to the other disturbances.
And the Rain Kept Falling

00:24:11.310 --> 00:24:12.770
But I was frantic.
And the Rain Kept Falling

00:24:12.770 --> 00:24:13.640
And the Rain Kept Falling

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:15.940
I think it's because of that day...
And the Rain Kept Falling

00:24:15.940 --> 00:24:19.570
that I was able to continue my journey with Van. Truly.
